    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57377" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κικκᾰβαῦ</span></b> , onomatop., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cry in imitation of the screech-owl's note</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				261
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κικκάβη</span></b> , ἡ, <i>screech-owl</i>, Sch.adloc.; cf.
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κικκάμη</span></b> , <i>noctua,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κικκᾰβάζω</span></b>  (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίζω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phot.
				</span></i>
			), <i>shriek like a screech-owl</i>, cj. Dobree for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακκ</span>- in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				761
			</span></i>.</div>
